  "description": "Ordinary ASP.NET Core API controllers and minimal API endpoints, hosted properly inside a Rask app. Maps controllers, and answers an unmatched request under the API prefix with an RFC 9457 problem document instead of letting the app's catch-all return a web page where the caller expected JSON. Pairs with Rask.Api.Client, whose typed client is generated from these endpoints, so a call site carries no URL string.",
